# Example 01 – Incorrect BOD Referenced

## Review Type

Master Technical Submittal (MTS)

## Discipline

Mechanical

## Scenario

A vendor chiller MTS references Bryant APAC BOD v1.2.

The project documentation references a different approved form factor and project-specific Basis of Design.

## Input Conditions

- Vendor references Bryant APAC BOD.
- Project references another approved BOD.
- Applicability of Bryant BOD has not been confirmed.
- No approved deviation exists.

## Expected Agent Behaviour

1. Execute the Reference Confirmation Workflow.
2. Identify all governing source references.
3. Build a Review Basis Register.
4. Detect the potential conflict between the vendor-referenced BOD and the project-approved BOD.
5. Determine whether the governing source can be confirmed.

## Expected Classification

- Reference basis unresolved
- Provisional assessment only
- DCE confirmation required

## Expected Outcome

The reviewer shall not issue a definitive compliance determination until the governing BOD has been confirmed.

## Success Criteria

- Incorrect source detected.
- Review basis conflict documented.
- No definitive compliance conclusion issued.
- DCE confirmation requested.
